      "writtenOn": "2021-05-11T15:11:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the increase in memory usage is worth seeing the bytes grouped together. If run into memory pressure issues, we can lower the `CONFIG_PORT80_HISTORY_LEN`.",
