      "writtenOn": "2021-05-11T02:23:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Basically for platforms that do not select CONFIG_PORT80_4_BYTE, last_boot will not be set to special event codes e.g. PORT_80_EVENT_RESUME/PORT_80_EVENT_RESET.\n\nBut, for platforms that select CONFIG_PORT80_4_BYTE, last_boot can be set to special event codes e.g. PORT_80_EVENT_RESUME/PORT_80_EVENT_RESET.\n\nThis creates inconsistency in behavior across different Chrome OS devices.",
      "parentUuid": "7e93ce10_d2fe59e7",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 71,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 71,
        "endChar": 54
